The movement cost model is informed by Baritone (https://github.com/cabaletta/baritone,
LGPL-3.0). No Baritone source files are included; some formulas (the octile heuristic, the jump
and parkour cost values, the block-placement and block-break cost values, the parkour gap limit)
have the same form as Baritone's, the list of special-case blocks is informed by Baritone's
MovementHelper, and several move types and the GoalBlock and GoalXZ goal types are modelled on
Baritone's Movement* and Goal* classes.
